yle=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          处理方式：高温发酵厌氧日晒 Thermolic Anaerobic Natural\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          风味：红色花朵、橙子、红布林、番石榴、柚子、桂圆干\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          Red flowers, Orange, Red plum, Guava, Pomelo, Dried longan\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          特别提示：这款豆子，需要比较久的养都豆期，喝的时候随着温度降低越来越好喝～\n         </span>\n<span style=\"color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          90+对于新的咖啡爱好者们可能有点陌生，但对于有3-5年以上的单品饮用经验的人应该会有概念，曾经世界赛手冲赛的前10选手有6名用的豆子都出自90+，甚至有连续6年里有5届手冲赛的世界赛冠军（2014/2015/2016/2017/2019）都是出自90+的豆子，它开创了很多个第一：第一个以特定的名字来命名咖啡产品，比如说展望Perci；第一个世界赛上辣么多辣么多的选手争相选用的豆子，可能是绝大多数选手的首选；第一个咖啡师选手参与加工处理并开创一个系列方式推出新的产品（创造者系列）；第一个提出超级采摘Super Picker并超额支付的（我信，看豆子的豆型一致性就能判断了）。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n          过去3年，90+随着疫情好像沉寂了，慢慢淡出了大家的视线，现在它带着新的品牌以及新的产品回归了，出于我们自己用豆子的方式，我们最终决定以手冲拼配的形式来呈现这个产品，本次产品的批次及组成比例为：（文章后面有加工方式的介绍）\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n            512/514（90+热发酵\n            <strong style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n              Thermolic™\n             </span>\n</strong>\n            ）10%\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n            510（90+冷发酵\n            <strong style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: normal;white-space: pre-line;caret-color: rgb(80, 85, 91);color: rgb(80, 85, 91);font-family: ITCFranklinGothicStd, sans-serif;font-size: 14.922278px;text-align: left;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n               Criolic Folio\n               <span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n                ™\n               </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n            ）30%\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n            516/517（90+\n            <span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n             冷发酵\n            </span>\n<strong style='caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: normal;white-space: pre-line;caret-color: rgb(80, 85, 91);color: rgb(80, 85, 91);font-family: ITCFranklinGothicStd, sans-serif;font-size: 14.922278px;text-align: left;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n               Criolic Folio\n               <span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n                ™）\n               </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: normal;white-space: pre-line;caret-color: rgb(80, 85, 91);color: rgb(80, 85, 91);font-family: ITCFranklinGothicStd, sans-serif;font-size: 14.922278px;text-align: left;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n<span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n               10%\n              </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n</span>\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n            640（Volcan Valley 热发酵\n            <strong style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n              Thermolic™\n             </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n            ）50%\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TtO2aoAicDDUfTfzibMsBn2DYzgQZRVzWhgr3f74tajBC4ZHo31Sbh4ybBMozuIOrlXKTiaGwgVKOHg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于90+（Ninety Plus）和 Volcan Valley\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍‍‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          2004年，当瑰夏一战成名后；市场上就开始逐渐显现热潮，也让一些有远见的咖啡人们看到了未来的一个方向；Joseph Brodsky就是其中之一，2007年他创立了Ninety Plus公司，在巴拿马购置了土地开始种植瑰夏，在生豆培育、品质控管与处理法上通过独树一格的做法来管控品质，他们是第一个实施Profile Processing制度来定义加工处理到成品，从品种、种植、採收到处理方式，为每一支咖啡豆量身打造处理过程，透过不断的杯测和校正，确保每支豆子都能发为属于它的独特风味；并且逐年的挑战咖啡的处理创新，形成自己的一套独特处理方式与产品，Ninety Plus的豆子也一直活跃在世界赛的赛场上，曾经有一年我记得手冲世界赛前10有6个选手选用竞赛的都是Ninety Plus的豆子。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TtO2aoAicDDUfTfzibMsBn2Dbf54rpopKRNQByZsJjuwum4Wk6hJZTT4MI4OVNnRKoIXyOj6uRFpeg/640?wx_fmt=webp&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          Joseph（左）和他的全能助理Tiger（右）\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TtO2aoAicDDUfTfzibMsBn2DmwSiaTZpFqGPdOLgU3Q4WppQ55gszzhOUS1hbDzsekNO1hxXrFkX26A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TtO2aoAicDDUfTfzibMsBn2Dz6rwqZDocibVmMwOdkZ2Gk0YKV7bXJDJIXegAEaAcOhf3ib6SZ6tHHWQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          2019年购入的Baru Estate 与Baru火山国家森林公园连接，海拔1800-2300，占地70公倾，是90+的“高科技”处理产品的大本营\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TtO2aoAicDDUfTfzibMsBn2D20qlhib10zbWBDss4FiawXmInwlibucwPQSO6o1DvKMaJoQy2cH7kKyMg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          The Makers' 系列\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          Volcan Valley是Ninety Plus的全新副牌，如果说Ninety Plus是为了竞赛级咖啡，为了金字塔顶端那一小撮Top的咖啡而生，那么Volcan Valley就是为了更为广大的消费端，它共享了Ninety Plus所有的处理经验与技术/设备/人力与产区资源，同时不仅仅是着眼在Gesha这一个品种上；Volcan Valley更像是一个社群项目，它覆盖的区域不仅仅有Ninety Plus自有的种植区，同时也有附近区域的咖农，品种涵盖Gesha, Catuai, Caturra, Typica, SL28和Pacamara等，让市场上有更多常规消费能触及的产品同时也可以帮助到那些参与进项目的区域咖农们。\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TtO2aoAicDDUfTfzibMsBn2DbZoMBNIuicffQIeeCfYmzYoBrVcr3vmhnHQ1GdUFBic2y6EMP1dafAKQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;'>\n<strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;\">\n          关于90+的处理方式\n         </strong>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          以前对于90+的加工处理，网上能获取到的信息非常有限，随着时代的变迁，哈哈哈，终于可以在网上看到一些信息了，我相信后续会越来越多，越来越丰富翔实，让我们以学习的角度去了解它吧：\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Criolic\n           <span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n            ™\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n</span>\n          ，这是90+的一种加工处理专利，利用低温来减缓咖啡粘液中糖和其他复杂蛋白质的分解。 这个过程从新鲜采摘的咖啡果开始，用水或其他方式低温储存。 在 CriolicTM 过程中，咖啡果会暴露在氧气控制环境中的低温下，通常约为 4 至 10 摄氏度， 氧气控制环境可以显着影响所得咖啡的风味特征，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          通过控制发酵过程中可用的氧气，咖啡果中存在的微生菌可以产生传统方法加工的咖啡所没有的独特风味和香气。 加工阶段完成后，咖啡豆将被放置在红室（Red Room我还没找到详细介绍，可能是红外线的暗房）的非洲高架床上的顶层，干燥成厚度不超过 2 厘米的单层结构，直至湿度达到 18%，然后逐渐移至较低层以延长干燥时间；干燥期间，白天每两小时搅拌一次，保证更为均匀一致的干燥。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          第一只用这种方式处理的咖啡是Lot #227， 赢得了2017年布达佩斯的世界赛手冲赛的冠军；2019年采用酿酒酵母进行改进，获得了当年西雅图的世界赛手冲赛的冠军。\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: normal;white-space: pre-line;caret-color: rgb(80, 85, 91);color: rgb(80, 85, 91);font-family: ITCFranklinGothicStd, sans-serif;font-size: 14.922278px;text-align: left;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n            Criolic Folio\n            <span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n             ™\n            </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: normal;white-space: pre-line;caret-color: rgb(80, 85, 91);color: rgb(80, 85, 91);font-family: ITCFranklinGothicStd, sans-serif;font-size: 14.922278px;text-align: left;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n<span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n</span>\n</span>\n          ，它并不是如上所述的一个独立处理方法，相反，它是一个附加方式，可以添加到不同的处理方法（例如水洗）中，以提供更多深度和复杂性。 90+使用 FolioTM 来描述咖啡植物的一个或多个部分（例如叶子、樱桃、花等）在加工过程中的使用情况，它是Ninety Plus从2014年一直以来闻名的加工专业化水平的独特方式。 2020 年，Ninety Plus推出著名的Yuzo系列，就是该处理方式的第一款。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          过去几年，FolioTM不同方式应用的处理产品已在全球范围内赢得了众多全国冠军。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           Thermolic™\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          ，利用热量加速咖啡果胶中糖和其他复杂蛋白质的分解。 这个过程从新鲜采摘的咖啡果开始，利用阳光或其他方式逐渐加热以达到所需的温度。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          在 Thermolic™ 处理过程中，咖啡果会在氧气控制的环境中暴露在温暖或高温下，通常约为 30 至 50 摄氏度\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          环境。 氧气控制环境可以显着影响所得咖啡的风味特征，处理阶段的氧气含量也会显着影响所得咖啡的风味特征。 通过控制发酵过程中可用的氧气，咖啡果中存在的微生菌可以产生传统方法加工的咖啡所没有的独特风味和香气。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          第一批使用这种方法生产的咖啡是来自埃塞俄比亚 Shakiso Estates 的 2013 年 Simeon Abbay 咖啡，两年后，该咖啡赢得了 2015 年在斯德哥尔摩举行的世界冲煮杯冠军。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: center;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: center;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 431px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
